ldren":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"Español Elegir idioma","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Español"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/es/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Iniciar sesión"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/es/book/02"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Volver al índice"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["No morir lentamente"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Consejos del capítulo"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Dejar de fumar, cuanto antes mejor"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"No fume en casa ni en el coche, y no permita que sus invitados fumen en su hogar"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Dejar de fumar no se logra solo con resistencia: primero hay que tomar medicación; la tasa de éxito se duplica"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Elija una fecha para dejar de fumar y no reduzca la cantidad gradualmente"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Acuda a una clínica para dejar de fumar o llame al 12320 para preguntar si hay servicios disponibles en su zona"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Quienes ya son fumadores no deben pensar en usar cigarrillos electrónicos; quienes nunca han fumado, mejor ni los prueben"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"No beber bebidas azucaradas; cambiar a versiones sin azúcar tampoco soluciona el problema"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"No masticar betel"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Cambie la sal de cocina por sal baja en sodio (sal de potasio)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Cepíllese los dientes a fondo y limpie los espacios interdentales a diario; reponga los dientes que falten sin demora"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Caminar entre 7000 y 8000 pasos al día, o hacer ejercicio rápido durante 150–300 minutos a la semana"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Quienes padecen hipertensión o hipercolesterolemia deben tomar los medicamentos según las indicaciones médicas; no deben interrumpirlos por su cuenta"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Dormir unas 7 horas cada noche y mantener una rutina regular"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Practica regularmente deportes de raqueta como tenis, bádminton o tenis de mesa"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Acumular actividades de esfuerzo breves, como subir escaleras o caminar rápido, hasta sumar unos cuatro o cinco minutos al día"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Hacer entrenamiento de fuerza 30–60 minutos por semana"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"No se quede sentado durante mucho tiempo seguido; levántese de vez en cuando"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Consumir menos carne procesada (jamón, tocino, salchichas, carne enlatada)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Beber menos o no beber alcohol"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/es/tip/02-20","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Personas que beben a diario y sufren temblores y palpitaciones al dejarlo: no intenten dejarlo solos"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Si quieres beber menos, primero cuenta cuánto bebes a la semana y luego habla unos minutos con el médico"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Consumir un puñado pequeño de frutos secos cada día"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Cambiar parte de la carne roja por pescado y carne de ave"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Cambie parte del arroz blanco y la harina refinada por cereales integrales"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"Beber té más de tres veces por semana"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Beber de tres a cuatro tazas de café al día, sin azúcar ni nata"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"Consumir 5 porciones diarias (unos 400 g) de frutas y verduras"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"Consumir menos alimentos ultraprocesados (patatas fritas, fideos instantáneos, pasteles, comidas rápidas)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"Cambiar de carbón y leña a electricidad o gas para cocinar y calentarse"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"Deje enfriar las bebidas calientes antes de beberlas; evite el té, la sopa y el café muy calientes"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"Salir al sol durante el día, no evites la luz natural"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-32"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"Mantener el IMC entre 20 y 25; si se tiene sobrepeso, hay que adelgazar"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-33"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"Consumir chile más de cuatro veces por semana"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-34"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"Beber una o dos porciones de leche o yogur al día"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-35"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"No es necesario evitar los huevos, pero no los consumas tres o cuatro al día"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-36"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"Si es posible, tome un baño de inmersión; no se limite a una ducha"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-37"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"Limite la siesta a media hora, no más de una hora; si necesita dormir una o dos horas para aguantar, debería investigar el motivo"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-38"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"Dormir más la noche siguiente a una noche de desvelo, sin esperar al fin de semana"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-39"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"Cuanto más tiempo trabaje de noche, mayor es el riesgo cardiovascular; si puede, cámbiese de puesto cuanto antes"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-40"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"Compre aceite de cacahuete envasado con un número de autorización SC; evite el aceite casero de pequeños productores"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-41"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"Cambiar el aceite vegetal por manteca de cerdo o mantequilla al cocinar no requiere cambiar de aceite por motivos de salud, ni tampoco hay que esperar que el aceite de linaza proteja el corazón"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"Encender el extractor de humos al cocinar y mantenerlo encendido hasta terminar"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-43"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"Si los sofocos y los sudores nocturnos alrededor de la menopausia afectan a tu vida, acude a ginecología para valorar la terapia hormonal; no los aguantes ni compres medicamentos por tu cuenta, y no la uses para prevenir enfermedades cardíacas"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/02-44"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"Si ya quería un perro, cuente el paseo diario como parte de sus pasos, pero no tenga un perro solo por longevidad"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Ruta de navegación"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book"},"children":["Libro"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book/02"},"children":["Capítulo 2"," ·"," ","No morir lentamente"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"02-20"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["20"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidencia"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"es"},"children":["Personas que beben a diario y sufren temblores y palpitaciones al dejarlo: no intenten dejarlo solos"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"es","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Quienes consumen grandes cantidades de alcohol a diario pueden presentar síndrome de abstinencia al interrumpirlo bruscamente. En casos leves, aparecen temblores, sudoración, palpitaciones e insomnio; en los más graves, convulsiones o delirium tremens, una afección potencialmente mortal. Un estudio noruego siguió a más de 30 000 personas: entre quienes sufrieron delirium tremens, el 8 % falleció cada año posteriormente. Si desean dejar el alcohol, lo mejor es acudir primero al hospital y explicar cuánto consumen diariamente."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["El precio de una consulta en psiquiatría o en medicina de…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Una revisión clínica de 2026 señala que las personas con consumo prolongado y excesivo de alcohol pueden desar…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Marcar: Personas que beben a diario y sufren temblores y palpitaciones al dejarlo: no intenten dejarlo solos"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Hecho"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Por hacer"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Guardar"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Compartir consejo"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Ocultar detalles"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["El precio de una consulta en psiquiatría o en medicina de adicciones varía entre unos pocos y varias decenas de euros. En casos graves, puede ser necesario ingresar al hospital por varios días."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Una revisión clínica de 2026 señala que las personas con consumo prolongado y excesivo de alcohol pueden desarrollar síndrome de abstinencia tras reducir o interrumpir bruscamente su ingesta; los síntomas incluyen temblores, hiperactividad del sistema nervioso autónomo, ansiedad, insomnio, alteraciones sensoriales, crisis epilépticas y delirium tremens, situaciones que se consideran «frecuentes y potencialmente letales» en la práctica médica general. En Noruega, un registro nacional incluyó a 36 287 individuos diagnosticados entre 2009 y 2015 con dependencia alcohólica, estado de abstinencia o delirium tremens. La tasa anual de mortalidad fue del 8,0 % en el grupo con delirium tremens, del 5,0 % en el de abstinencia y del 3,6 % en el de dependencia alcohólica. El cociente de mortalidad estandarizado para el grupo con delirium tremens fue de 9,8 (IC 95 %: 8,9–10,7), lo que indica que su riesgo de fallecer es aproximadamente 9,8 veces superior al de la población general de la misma edad."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Caputo F, Lungaro L, Costanzini A, De Giorgio R, Addolorato G (2026). Alcohol withdrawal syndrome in hospitalized patients: a practical review. European Journal of Internal Medicine, 107103. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejim.2026.107103","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejim.2026.107103"]},"；Bramness JG, Heiberg IH, Høye A, Rossow I (2023). Mortality and alcohol-related morbidity in patients with delirium tremens, alcohol withdrawal state or alcohol dependence in Norway: A register-based prospective cohort study. Addiction, 118(12), 2352–2359. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/add.16297","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/add.16297"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejim.2026.107103","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Abrir fuente"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nota del autor"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Para saber si usted se encuentra en esta situación: si bebe casi a diario y al no hacerlo experimenta temblores, sudoración, palpitaciones e insomnio, o si necesita tomar alcohol por la mañana para sentirse bien, no intente dejarlo por su cuenta. La práctica habitual en los hospitales consiste en administrar fármacos benzodiazepínicos para superar esos días críticos, además de suplementar tiamina (las vitaminas B1). Se asigna el nivel B porque el estudio noruego describe «qué ocurre después a quienes ya han padecido delirium tremens», no «qué sucede al intentar dejarlo solos», por lo que se trata de una inferencia. De todos modos, lo ideal es dejar el alcohol, pero bajo supervisión médica. El apartado 19 de esta sección explica cuánto consumo se considera «moderado» (poco o nada de alcohol); para reducirlo, consulte el apartado 21, donde se explica cómo contar las copas antes de acudir al médico."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Escribe un recordatorio…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/es/tip/02-19"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http